Author README
-------------

In order to show the progression of normal development,
I am keeping all of the intermediary development snippets here.
In order to run an example snippet to get an output you need to
symlink the snippet to the actual name being used.

  ln -sf 0-dimuonmass.py dimuonmass.py

Originally, this example was authored with Coffea 2026.9.0 within
the AlmaLinux 9 image. If you have denv[0] installed,

  denv init coffeateam/coffea-dask-almalinux9:2026.9.0-py3.13
  # choose which stage to update/run
  ln -sf 0-dimuonmass.py dimuonmass.py
  # run and view output
  denv python3 run-local.py

[0]: https://tomeichlersmith.github.io/denv/
